  "limits": [
    "The existing Agent picker emits namespace and a null owner; Agent resolution uses the visible hierarchy. Exact declared relative binding is preserved. This migration does not claim backend homonym-owner support or silently pin an inferred Instance owner.",
    "The existing Work Entry update API supplies no ETag and retains its last-write-wins contract.",
    "The official Assistant profile currently contains ambiguous Tool ownership across Instance and Workspace and is not modified by this screen migration. The provenance journey requires a successful real Bootstrap application of an isolated Workspace test profile and does not accept a partially applied official profile.",
    "An initial temporary French probe checked an old mounted circuit after saving preferences through the API. The final setup verifies persisted language/theme, opens the real editor, then checks its actual appearance; no product fix, timeout increase or assertion reduction was used."
  ],
